{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"哥林多后书","commonName":"哥林多后书","title":"哥林多后书","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"d0dd80ed359d9a2e87b2ade748d7f57da0a8ac6ee10c7e0109988330338474ef","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这是我第三次到你们那里去，“各样事情必须凭两三个证人的口，才能确定。”",{"noteId":38}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["尽管我不在那里，但还是要再次警告他们，还有你们所有人——当我造访时，会毫不犹豫地对他们采取行动，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["因为你们在找基督借着我说话的凭据。基督对你们并非软弱，相反，他对你们是有能力的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他因软弱被钉死了，却靠着上帝的大能活着。我们在他里面也是软弱的，但靠着上帝向你们所显的大能，也必与他一同活着。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["你们应当察验自己是不是坚守信仰，也应当考验自己。难道不晓得基督耶稣就是与你们同在吗？",{"noteId":39},"（除非你们经不起考验。）"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我盼望你们知晓，我们并非经不起考验的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我们祈求上帝，让你们不要做什么恶事。这并不是要显示我们经得起考验，而是要你们行善。至于我们，就让我们做经不起考验的人好了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我们不能做什么违背真理的事，只能维护真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["当我们软弱、你们刚强的时候，我们就欢喜。我们所求的，就是要你们完整。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因此，我趁着不在你们那里的时候，把这些话写给你们，这样当我去了你们那里，就不必凭着主所给我的权力严厉地对待你们。这权力不是为了拆毁你们，而是要建立你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["最后，兄弟姐妹们，你们要欢喜，要圆满，要获得安慰，要同心，要和睦。这样，恩典赐予平安的上帝必与你们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们要用圣洁的亲吻彼此问安。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["众圣徒问候你们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["愿主耶稣基督的恩惠，上帝的慈爱，圣灵的交流，常与你们众人同在。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":38,"caller":"+","text":"引自《申命记》19:15。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":1}},{"noteId":39,"caller":"+","text":"或“与之联合。”","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":5}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2CO/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/GAL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/2CO/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}